# Sunburst counts colors, not mana: Black Lotus's three black mana pay for X = 3 and the Explosives enters with ONE charge
# counter (CR 702.44a), so it destroys mana value 1 (Bot2's Sol Ring) and leaves the mana value 2 Mind Stone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Engineered Explosives
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Sol Ring
Mind Stone
Mox Jet
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Engineered Explosives.Cast(X: 3)
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mind Stone.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Engineered Explosives.Counters.Charge = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Engineered Explosives.Activate

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mind Stone
Bot2.Graveyard = Sol Ring
